Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.79,0:01:05.61,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\3c&999944&\blur4}對輕咬示好的小貓們
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.59,0:01:11.43,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\3c&7744CB&\blur4}哄一哄 我們由此相視而笑
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.91,0:01:17.60,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\3c&55BA79&\blur4}如果我們永遠如此
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.78,0:01:20.63,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\3c&278BD3&\blur4}該是多麼平靜
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.63,0:01:23.15,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\3c&278BD3&\blur4}可是愛意襲來
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.19,0:01:26.96,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur4}催人越發急躁
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.83,0:01:29.81,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\3c&999944&\blur4}「要選誰呢？」
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.81,0:01:30.31,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,120)\3c&2222CC&\blur4}「要選誰呢？」
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.62,0:01:33.07,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\3c&2222CC&\blur4}就選你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.61,0:01:35.82,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\3c&773333&\blur4}「選誰都行？」
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.82,0:01:36.11,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,120)\3c&999944&\blur4}「選誰都行？」
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.49,0:01:38.79,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\3c&443333&\blur4}就非你不可！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.79,0:01:41.33,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\3c&A777CA&\fad(120,120)\an9\t(400,700,\3c&999944&)}如果可以的話
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.64,0:01:44.03,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\an9\blur4\3c&A777CA&}能像小貓輕咬般你儂我儂
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.18,0:01:49.03,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\an9\3c&A777CA&\blur4}這麼直到永遠就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.33,0:01:52.98,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur4\3c&A777CA&\t(500,2400,\3c&95B990&)}倘若我們認真起來
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.25,0:01:55.58,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\3c&A9A954&\blur4\t(300,2000,\3c&C777C3&)}心痛是在所難免的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.76,0:01:56.97,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\3c&D777C3&\blur4\t(300,1200,\3c&579BE3&)}更不用說會傷害到彼此
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.97,0:01:58.94,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\3c&579BE3&\blur4\t(0,1900,\3c&55BA79&)}更不用說會傷害到彼此
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.94,0:02:01.39,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,120)\3c&55BA79&\blur4\t(0,2500,\3c&C777C3&)}更不用說會傷害到彼此
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.56,0:02:01.92,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\frz-90\fn@\an4\pos(1800,404)\blur4\3c&C777C3&}而我許下願望
